    "Duration of therapy: guideline recommends 7 days for suspected sepsis (S005) vs plan’s 48‑72 h.",
    "Blood culture before first antibiotic dose (S006) not mentioned.",
    "Criteria to stop antibiotics at 36 h if culture negative and CRP reassuring (S009) omitted."
  ],
  "regimen_incomplete": true,
  "rationale": "Plan correctly identifies need for antibiotics and monitoring (S003, S014) but omits essential dosing, duration, and initial culture steps required by NICE (S004, S005, S006, S009). Missing dosing contradicts explicit guideline recommendations, reducing correctness, completeness, and safety."
